WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.133 --> 00:00:06.733
During the final battle between Ash and Alain at the Kalos League,

2
00:00:06.800 --> 00:00:10.200
Ash-Greninja faced Mega Charizard once more,

3
00:00:10.266 --> 00:00:11.633
and was defeated,

4
00:00:11.700 --> 00:00:14.433
leaving Alain as the Kalos League champion.

5
00:00:14.866 --> 00:00:18.600
But during the awards ceremony, an unexpected crisis occurred.

6
00:00:20.166 --> 00:00:23.733
It's here. The spotlight's on my greatest work of all.

7
00:00:33.233 --> 00:00:34.066
Go!

8
00:00:46.100 --> 00:00:48.266
- Where's Mairin?
- During the finals,

9
00:00:48.333 --> 00:00:51.333
she didn't wanna get in your way. She asked not to tell.

10
00:00:51.833 --> 00:00:53.733
She's always overthinking things.

11
00:00:55.066 --> 00:00:59.233
At a time like this, I guess I can ask. Is Mairin important to you?

12
00:01:00.933 --> 00:01:04.400
- Yeah.
- Let's go find her. We'll help you look.

13
00:01:07.933 --> 00:01:09.800
- What are those?
- Let's get out.

14
00:01:10.533 --> 00:01:13.000
- It's out here also.
- Pika.

15
00:01:13.066 --> 00:01:15.200
- Ash!
- There you are.

16
00:01:15.666 --> 00:01:18.000
- Are you all okay?
- Yeah, we're doing fine.

17
00:01:18.466 --> 00:01:21.700
Ash, Squishy disappeared. It ran off somewhere.

18
00:01:22.600 --> 00:01:26.066
Giant mysterious creeping vines are overrunning the city.

19
00:01:26.133 --> 00:01:29.366
There's been major damage centered around Prism Tower.

20
00:01:29.433 --> 00:01:31.833
Avoid that area during evacuation.

21
00:01:32.000 --> 00:01:35.233
Again, there has been major damage around Prism Tower.

22
00:01:35.300 --> 00:01:36.533
- What's that?
- Avoid that area.

23
00:01:36.600 --> 00:01:37.900
It's glowing.

24
00:01:37.966 --> 00:01:39.700
Could it be... Zygarde?

25
00:01:40.100 --> 00:01:41.333
What do you mean?

26
00:01:41.533 --> 00:01:44.200
Those vines are the work of Zygarde for sure.

27
00:01:44.266 --> 00:01:45.133
Oh, no.

28
00:01:48.433 --> 00:01:51.566
- Gotta get out of here.
- Respond. Respond!

29
00:02:18.800 --> 00:02:20.833
You! What is it?

30
00:02:20.900 --> 00:02:21.800
Respond!

31
00:02:22.066 --> 00:02:23.200
Respond!

32
00:02:29.733 --> 00:02:30.700
Squishy.

33
00:02:31.100 --> 00:02:33.700
Squishy's heading over to Prism Tower.

34
00:02:34.133 --> 00:02:35.133
What? Really?

35
00:02:35.433 --> 00:02:36.900
Yeah. I'm sure of it.

36
00:02:37.266 --> 00:02:40.766
- Bonnie! Wait!
- Go! We'll catch up with you later.

37
00:02:40.833 --> 00:02:41.766
What about you?

38
00:02:41.833 --> 00:02:44.466
- I'm going with Alain to find Mairin.
- But--

39
00:02:44.533 --> 00:02:47.466
- I'll see you as soon as we find her.
- Hey, Ash.

40
00:02:48.366 --> 00:02:50.766
Take this! It's a communicator.

41
00:02:51.200 --> 00:02:54.666
I thought we'd encounter a situation like this one.

42
00:02:54.733 --> 00:02:57.300
Not that powerful, but should come in handy.

43
00:02:57.500 --> 00:02:58.466
Thanks, Clemont.

44
00:02:58.900 --> 00:03:01.033
- Be careful, okay?
- I will.

45
00:03:02.333 --> 00:03:04.233
This way! And stay calm!

46
00:03:06.366 --> 00:03:07.666
Sceptile, Leaf Blade!

47
00:03:14.400 --> 00:03:17.466
- All right, hurry up.
- We're gonna make a path.

48
00:03:17.900 --> 00:03:19.200
Ivysaur, let's go!

49
00:03:19.266 --> 00:03:21.466
- You, too, Charizard!
- Blastoise!

50
00:03:26.633 --> 00:03:28.233
Everyone, that way!

51
00:03:34.133 --> 00:03:35.366
Green fire.

52
00:03:35.433 --> 00:03:37.066
A flickering green flame.

53
00:03:37.133 --> 00:03:38.666
I saw it engulf Kalos

54
00:03:38.733 --> 00:03:42.733
and threaten to consume people and Pokémon in that swirling fire.

55
00:03:42.800 --> 00:03:46.033
So, Olympia foresaw this was going to happen.

56
00:03:48.433 --> 00:03:52.433
You will all play a substantial role in the chaos and turmoil.

57
00:03:54.233 --> 00:03:56.900
But where exactly are Ash and the others now?

58
00:04:32.533 --> 00:04:34.600
A towering takeover!

59
00:04:39.033 --> 00:04:41.566
Run! Hurry! We have to go!

60
00:04:47.666 --> 00:04:49.866
- Are you all right?
- Yes, ma'am.

61
00:04:50.300 --> 00:04:53.600
- Thank you very much.
- Officer Jenny. Glad you're here.

62
00:04:53.666 --> 00:04:55.400
How is the evacuation going?

63
00:04:55.466 --> 00:04:59.066
I've got every officer on duty, but the damage is spreading.

64
00:04:59.400 --> 00:05:02.300
- Show me the way to the tower, please.
- Right.

65
00:05:06.433 --> 00:05:11.333
- This is crazy! What is going on?
- Doesn't appear to be a natural disaster.

66
00:05:11.400 --> 00:05:14.133
Get those out! Get those things out of here!

67
00:05:14.200 --> 00:05:15.133
It's Lysandre.

68
00:05:19.500 --> 00:05:20.333
Mairin!

69
00:05:21.400 --> 00:05:22.233
Mairin!

70
00:05:22.500 --> 00:05:25.833
It's Alain! Alain!

71
00:05:27.133 --> 00:05:29.200
- Mairin!
- Mairin, over here!

72
00:05:29.266 --> 00:05:31.133
We need to get to Prism Tower!

73
00:05:31.566 --> 00:05:33.133
Alain!

74
00:05:33.566 --> 00:05:34.600
I'll save you!

75
00:05:35.100 --> 00:05:36.166
Charizard!

76
00:05:39.333 --> 00:05:40.766
Use Dragon Claw!

77
00:05:46.166 --> 00:05:47.033
Yes.

78
00:05:47.833 --> 00:05:49.533
Pikachu, Iron Tail!

79
00:05:55.600 --> 00:05:58.766
- Somebody!
- Do not get into your vehicles!

80
00:06:01.266 --> 00:06:02.100
Respond!

81
00:06:02.700 --> 00:06:03.766
What's going on?

82
00:06:05.266 --> 00:06:08.733
- Hey! Where are you going?
- This show's off the air.

83
00:06:08.933 --> 00:06:12.500
- As for you, you can do whatever you like.
- But, Malva!

84
00:06:12.566 --> 00:06:14.833
You mean you're just gonna stop reporting?

85
00:06:15.600 --> 00:06:18.266
I remembered something very important.

86
00:06:19.666 --> 00:06:21.700
Of all the nerve... I never!

87
00:06:22.533 --> 00:06:24.800
Hold on a minute. I've got an idea.

88
00:06:24.866 --> 00:06:25.833
Camera.

89
00:06:26.366 --> 00:06:27.200
All right.

90
00:06:27.833 --> 00:06:29.033
Good. Ready.

91
00:06:29.300 --> 00:06:30.133
Go!

92
00:06:34.100 --> 00:06:36.033
To anyone who can hear...

93
00:06:36.500 --> 00:06:38.633
I'm reporting from Lumiose Stadium.

94
00:06:38.733 --> 00:06:43.000
The Kalos League award ceremony was interrupted by a terrible calamity.

95
00:06:44.100 --> 00:06:46.733
A sudden attack by mysterious creeping vines

96
00:06:46.800 --> 00:06:49.033
has left Lumiose City in ruins.

97
00:06:49.766 --> 00:06:51.900
What exactly is going on here?

98
00:06:52.466 --> 00:06:53.533
Please stay tuned.

99
00:06:53.600 --> 00:06:57.033
I, Jesse Murrow, will continue broadcasting live updates.

100
00:07:00.933 --> 00:07:01.766
How's that?

101
00:07:05.000 --> 00:07:06.600
Okay, pay attention!

102
00:07:08.400 --> 00:07:10.466
Are you finally ready to listen?

103
00:07:10.900 --> 00:07:13.466
I know you. You were hunting for Squishy.

104
00:07:13.533 --> 00:07:15.466
Wonderful. You remembered.

105
00:07:15.933 --> 00:07:18.366
But today I'm after something different.

106
00:07:18.566 --> 00:07:19.766
Now I'm after you.

107
00:07:20.200 --> 00:07:21.766
- After me?
- Pika?

108
00:07:22.200 --> 00:07:23.533
What do you mean?

109
00:07:23.600 --> 00:07:25.466
Lysandre's orders.

110
00:07:25.533 --> 00:07:27.966
Alain, wait. Do you know who she is?

111
00:07:29.700 --> 00:07:30.733
Hey, Alain?

112
00:07:31.300 --> 00:07:34.500
Does he know me? Of course he does. We're colleagues.

113
00:07:34.933 --> 00:07:37.700
You're working with the ones chasing Squishy?

114
00:07:38.133 --> 00:07:39.733
What is she talking about?

115
00:07:41.133 --> 00:07:44.833
Lysandre wants to see you now, so come with me right away.

116
00:07:44.900 --> 00:07:48.566
My associate has gone after Squishy. Let's get moving, Alain.

117
00:07:48.633 --> 00:07:52.000
Alain. Whatever she's saying, don't listen to it.

118
00:07:52.733 --> 00:07:53.566
Let's go.

119
00:07:56.666 --> 00:07:57.500
Alain.

120
00:07:59.500 --> 00:08:01.466
Now, Drapion, Confuse Ray!

121
00:08:09.766 --> 00:08:12.500
Alain, what's... going on?

122
00:08:16.133 --> 00:08:18.633
Pika? Pika?

123
00:08:25.533 --> 00:08:29.166
Oh, dear. Look who loves its trainer.

124
00:08:32.633 --> 00:08:34.033
- Grab them!
- Right.

125
00:08:42.433 --> 00:08:45.000
This is Jesse Murrow, reporting to you live

126
00:08:45.066 --> 00:08:46.466
from Lumiose Stadium.

127
00:08:46.533 --> 00:08:49.633
You can see the massive damage to Lumiose City.

128
00:08:49.700 --> 00:08:51.033
Something's weird.

129
00:08:51.300 --> 00:08:52.866
- Hey!
- What?

130
00:08:58.566 --> 00:09:01.866
To my beloved Kalos region and the entire world...

131
00:09:02.300 --> 00:09:03.666
I am Lysandre.

132
00:09:04.100 --> 00:09:06.533
Team Flare is with me to do my bidding.

133
00:09:08.100 --> 00:09:09.033
I know him.

134
00:09:09.100 --> 00:09:10.900
I have an announcement.

135
00:09:11.733 --> 00:09:12.766
Lysandre.

136
00:09:13.366 --> 00:09:15.766
We are here to remake the world...

137
00:09:16.200 --> 00:09:18.900
into a place of pure beauty and peace.

138
00:09:20.666 --> 00:09:22.500
Who's that Pokémon?

139
00:09:27.100 --> 00:09:29.633
It's Zygarde 10% Forme!

140
00:09:33.100 --> 00:09:36.333
Team Flare's purpose is to transform our world

141
00:09:36.400 --> 00:09:38.866
into an exquisite example of creation.

142
00:09:39.733 --> 00:09:42.266
This Pokémon's name is Zygarde,

143
00:09:42.333 --> 00:09:47.333
a legendary Pokémon who will preside over the new order of the Kalos region.

144
00:09:47.400 --> 00:09:50.200
So, as leaders of this new order,

145
00:09:50.266 --> 00:09:54.533
we have decided to join forces with this powerful guardian of creation.

146
00:09:55.733 --> 00:10:00.833
Zygarde is angry at the behavior of both people and Pokémon.

147
00:10:01.866 --> 00:10:04.733
The discipline of this world has been lost.

148
00:10:04.800 --> 00:10:07.000
Humanity is out of control.

149
00:10:07.066 --> 00:10:09.333
We have forgotten how to share.

150
00:10:11.366 --> 00:10:14.833
Without sharing, people begin to steal from each other.

151
00:10:15.433 --> 00:10:18.466
When that happens, there is not enough for anyone.

152
00:10:18.666 --> 00:10:21.233
In order to live in peace without stealing,

153
00:10:21.300 --> 00:10:24.033
we must reduce the number of beings on this planet.

154
00:10:24.100 --> 00:10:28.033
Only the chosen ones will move into our bright, hopeful future.

155
00:10:29.366 --> 00:10:33.100
We of Team Flare, along with the fury of Zygarde,

156
00:10:33.166 --> 00:10:35.833
will be the ones who will make that judgment.

157
00:10:37.366 --> 00:10:40.900
The new order will do away with the chaos of the world

158
00:10:40.966 --> 00:10:43.766
and bring about the beautiful future we desire.

159
00:10:45.333 --> 00:10:48.266
- I can't believe that.
- Can he even do that?

160
00:10:49.366 --> 00:10:50.433
But why?

161
00:10:50.933 --> 00:10:55.200
Mairin? We have orders from Lysandre to bring you to him right away.

162
00:10:55.400 --> 00:10:58.133
Huh? So, you're the bad guys, too.

163
00:10:58.566 --> 00:11:02.666
No. We are doing all this for the cause of world peace.

164
00:11:03.133 --> 00:11:03.966
Stop!

165
00:11:05.400 --> 00:11:07.400
Huh? Professor.

166
00:11:07.466 --> 00:11:11.200
Forcing anyone to do something against their will is wrong.

167
00:11:11.433 --> 00:11:13.700
- I don't like that.
- Keep out of this!

168
00:11:16.933 --> 00:11:18.466
Skorupi, poison sting!

169
00:11:18.533 --> 00:11:20.233
Garchomp! Dragon claw!

170
00:11:46.600 --> 00:11:50.033
- Are you okay?
- I'm fine, thanks to you, professor.

171
00:11:50.100 --> 00:11:52.466
- But what about Alain?
- You saw him?

172
00:11:52.766 --> 00:11:54.600
That's right. He was with Ash.

173
00:11:54.966 --> 00:11:57.166
They were talking about Prism Tower.

174
00:11:57.433 --> 00:11:58.333
I see.

175
00:11:58.766 --> 00:12:01.233
He and Ash may be in grave danger.

176
00:12:02.633 --> 00:12:06.400
- We need to head there now. Stay close.
- Okay.

177
00:12:06.833 --> 00:12:10.766
I'm worried, professor, about all that stuff Lysandre was saying.

178
00:12:11.200 --> 00:12:15.133
Yes. We have to be careful and find out what's really going on.

179
00:12:25.566 --> 00:12:27.833
Hello, Alain. Lysandre's waiting.

180
00:12:28.266 --> 00:12:30.833
What about Zygarde? Why did you involve Ash?

181
00:12:30.900 --> 00:12:34.333
Lysandre will soon give you all the details.

182
00:12:48.766 --> 00:12:49.633
Lysandre.

183
00:12:50.433 --> 00:12:52.566
There you are. Alain.

184
00:12:53.100 --> 00:12:55.666
What do you think? Isn't it exquisite?

185
00:12:55.733 --> 00:12:56.666
Huh?

186
00:12:56.733 --> 00:12:59.733
Thanks to you, the system is complete.

187
00:13:00.433 --> 00:13:02.733
But wait, it still isn't--

188
00:13:02.800 --> 00:13:06.566
The world will be at peace just as I've been working toward.

189
00:13:33.833 --> 00:13:35.100
Isn't it beautiful?

190
00:13:35.366 --> 00:13:38.133
All of the ugliness is slowly disappearing.

191
00:13:38.333 --> 00:13:39.233
Behold.

192
00:13:41.066 --> 00:13:44.666
You see, Zygarde represents all of our anger and rage.

193
00:13:44.733 --> 00:13:47.166
You're destroying the city and hurting people.

194
00:13:47.233 --> 00:13:50.066
Is this what you think world peace is about?

195
00:13:50.133 --> 00:13:51.966
You said you're protecting us!

196
00:13:52.100 --> 00:13:54.266
Yes. I'm protecting...

197
00:13:54.700 --> 00:13:56.666
the chosen ones only.

198
00:14:12.366 --> 00:14:13.266
What is it?

199
00:14:13.800 --> 00:14:15.800
Aren't you able to hear my voice?

200
00:14:20.033 --> 00:14:21.066
Answer me!

201
00:14:21.233 --> 00:14:22.766
Don't you know me?!

202
00:14:24.233 --> 00:14:26.200
You're here, Z1.

203
00:14:34.866 --> 00:14:36.566
I'm afraid it's no use.

204
00:14:47.600 --> 00:14:48.533
Clembot!

205
00:14:48.966 --> 00:14:51.700
Yes. Yours truly, at your service.

206
00:14:52.666 --> 00:14:54.266
Thanks a lot, Heliolisk!

207
00:14:54.533 --> 00:14:57.833
If my master is in a jam, I'll always be there to help.

208
00:14:59.166 --> 00:15:00.800
Clembot, way to go.

209
00:15:01.066 --> 00:15:04.533
I need your help now. I want to go to Prism Tower.

210
00:15:04.600 --> 00:15:05.766
Right away.

211
00:15:13.633 --> 00:15:15.600
That was close, young ones.

212
00:15:16.433 --> 00:15:17.733
Blaziken Mask!

213
00:15:20.300 --> 00:15:23.033
I'm here now, so all of you can relax.

214
00:15:23.466 --> 00:15:27.533
Blaziken Mask, I think the Prism Tower is the source of all this trouble.

215
00:15:28.200 --> 00:15:31.566
If you can go and help, maybe you can save Lumiose City.

216
00:15:31.633 --> 00:15:33.700
Understood. Leave it to me.

217
00:15:33.933 --> 00:15:36.633
- You and the others seek safety.
- Come on.

218
00:15:37.233 --> 00:15:38.633
That's where my gym is.

219
00:15:38.700 --> 00:15:39.933
And Squishy, too.

220
00:15:40.900 --> 00:15:43.833
Stay away. Who knows what I'll find there.

221
00:15:43.900 --> 00:15:48.366
- You could be in mortal danger.
- But Squishy's my dear little friend.

222
00:15:48.800 --> 00:15:52.966
I can't just abandon the Lumiose Gym. I have precious memories there.

223
00:15:55.933 --> 00:15:58.800
If I don't do something, I'll regret it forever.

224
00:15:59.066 --> 00:16:01.366
- Come on.
- Let us go, too.

225
00:16:03.400 --> 00:16:06.600
I understand. I'll allow you to follow behind me.

226
00:16:07.033 --> 00:16:10.466
But if there's any sign of danger, you have to turn back.

227
00:16:10.533 --> 00:16:11.600
Right.

228
00:16:14.200 --> 00:16:15.266
Wake up!

229
00:16:37.866 --> 00:16:40.000
- Bonnie?
- It's Squishy.

230
00:16:40.700 --> 00:16:42.000
Huh? What's wrong?

231
00:16:42.833 --> 00:16:44.533
Squishy's in a lot of pain.

232
00:16:45.100 --> 00:16:46.233
We've gotta hurry!

233
00:16:46.866 --> 00:16:48.200
Almost there. Come on!

234
00:16:51.200 --> 00:16:53.666
Lysandre... you said it yourself.

235
00:16:53.900 --> 00:16:58.366
You had to be strong to protect the world. Is this what you meant by that?

236
00:16:59.100 --> 00:17:01.233
You speak of the power to protect.

237
00:17:02.033 --> 00:17:05.200
Just what do you want to protect in the first place?

238
00:17:05.333 --> 00:17:07.599
A tomorrow that is worse than today?

239
00:17:10.700 --> 00:17:13.800
- All preparations complete.
- Excellent.

240
00:17:32.800 --> 00:17:35.800
- This is horrible!
- Where's Squishy?

241
00:17:35.866 --> 00:17:37.700
First we secure the entrance.

242
00:17:38.133 --> 00:17:39.166
Use Flamethrower!

243
00:17:41.966 --> 00:17:43.233
-Blaziken!

244
00:17:43.466 --> 00:17:45.866
- We can't allow that.
- Team Flare!

245
00:17:46.333 --> 00:17:48.700
Sorry, no way you're getting past us.

246
00:17:48.766 --> 00:17:51.366
This area is off-limits to outsiders.

247
00:17:56.133 --> 00:17:57.200
Huh?

248
00:17:57.833 --> 00:17:59.533
What am I doing like this?

249
00:18:03.900 --> 00:18:04.900
Greninja!

250
00:18:04.966 --> 00:18:06.633
Pika...

251
00:18:06.700 --> 00:18:07.533
Pikachu.

252
00:18:07.600 --> 00:18:08.833
Are all of you okay?

253
00:18:08.900 --> 00:18:10.400
Pikachu...

254
00:18:10.466 --> 00:18:11.900
Hello, Ash.

255
00:18:12.833 --> 00:18:14.466
Lysandre! Alain!

256
00:18:14.633 --> 00:18:15.733
What's going on?

257
00:18:15.800 --> 00:18:16.766
Let us go!

258
00:18:17.466 --> 00:18:20.400
Forgive me for your regrettably rough treatment.

259
00:18:20.966 --> 00:18:22.433
But I can't release you.

260
00:18:23.533 --> 00:18:24.400
Zygarde!

261
00:18:26.500 --> 00:18:28.300
Alain, what's this about?

262
00:18:30.600 --> 00:18:34.566
You see, Ash, you may be one of the chosen ones.

263
00:18:37.133 --> 00:18:40.066
I think you're the ones who should be leaving!

264
00:18:40.500 --> 00:18:42.266
The Lumiose Gym is mine!

265
00:18:42.333 --> 00:18:44.066
I have the right to be here!

266
00:18:44.500 --> 00:18:46.666
- Oh, puh-lease.
- Yeah.

267
00:18:46.733 --> 00:18:49.533
So, Team Flare was behind all of this.

268
00:18:49.766 --> 00:18:53.666
Yes. And it looks to me like they're up to no good for sure.

269
00:18:54.100 --> 00:18:57.166
The situation here is more serious than I imagined.

270
00:18:58.566 --> 00:18:59.466
It's Squishy.

271
00:19:28.133 --> 00:19:30.500
- Squishy!
- Z1!

272
00:19:32.033 --> 00:19:32.866
Pika?

273
00:19:53.333 --> 00:19:54.633
Squishy, yay!

274
00:19:56.133 --> 00:19:57.466
So, Squishy is...

275
00:19:57.800 --> 00:19:58.633
Is Zygarde.

276
00:19:59.166 --> 00:20:00.666
Hmm.

277
00:20:02.566 --> 00:20:05.466
- No way!
- That's unbelievable.

278
00:20:05.900 --> 00:20:07.300
Well, what do you know?

279
00:20:07.366 --> 00:20:10.966
Zygarde has appeared just as Lysandre said that it would.

280
00:20:15.600 --> 00:20:18.866
If you will not listen to me, I will use force!

281
00:20:18.933 --> 00:20:20.100
Ignorant fool!

282
00:20:30.766 --> 00:20:34.866
Amidst the ruins of Lumiose City, two Zygarde now clash.

283
00:20:35.100 --> 00:20:37.300
What will happen to our heroes?

284
00:20:37.600 --> 00:20:38.966
And what about Alain?

285
00:20:39.366 --> 00:20:43.066
Lysandre's dangerous ambition continues to run wild...

286
00:20:43.200 --> 00:20:45.566
as the journey continues.
